<title>BRAZIL: Petrobras BR 10-mo net $110.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Petrobras BR 10-mo net $110.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state oil products distributor Petrobras BR Distruidora, a unit of federal oil monopoly Petrobras, released the following 10-month 1996 net profit.</p>
<p>		     Jan-Oct 1996	Jan-Oct 1995</p>
<p>    Net		  $110.7 million	  $163.3 million</p>
<p>    Gross Sales	$7.244 bln	  $6.85 bln</p>
<p>Note: Figures in U.S. dollars and not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>--James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 248 5413</p>
</text>
